more than 9.9% in value or in number of shares, whichever is
more restrictive, of the issued and outstanding shares of our
common stock. Any purported transfer of our shares that would
result in a violation of either of these limits will result in
such shares being transferred to a trust for the benefit of a
charitable beneficiary or such transfer being declared null and
