</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt;color: #000000; background: #ffffff; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; ">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Triple Net Properties maintains the
<FONT style="white-space: nowrap">day-to</FONT>-day accounting
for the LLC as well as the books and records for the property.
In addition, Triple Net Properties is required to report
financial data pertinent to the operation of each program and is
