</DIV>

<!-- link1 "Our Advisor May Have Conflicting Fiduciary Obligations in the Event Our Company Acquires Properties with Our Advisor&#146;s Affiliates" -->

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt;color: #000000; background: #ffffff; margin-top: 12pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; ">
<B>Our Advisor May Have Conflicting Fiduciary Obligations in the
Event Our Company Acquires Properties with Our Advisor&#146;s
Affiliates</B>
</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt;color: #000000; background: #ffffff; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; ">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
