<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt;color: #000000; background: #ffffff; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; ">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
Stockholder rights and related matters are governed by the
Maryland General Corporation Law, or MGCL, and our charter and
bylaws. Our board of directors, including our independent
directors, unanimously approved our charter and bylaws. A
majority of our independent directors must approve or ratify any
subsequent amendment to our charter and bylaws. Provisions of
