incapacity of a director or by an increase in the number of
directors may be filled only by the vote of a majority of the
remaining directors, even if the remaining directors do not
constitute a quorum, and any director elected to fill a vacancy
will serve for the remainder of the full term of the
directorship in which the vacancy occurred. With respect to a
vacancy created by the death, resignation or incapacity of an
independent director, the remaining independent directors will
nominate a replacement. Any director may
