<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt;color: #000000; background: #ffffff; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; ">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
A corporation that is a &#147;qualified REIT subsidiary&#148; is
not treated as a corporation separate from its parent REIT. All
assets, liabilities and items of income, deduction and credit of
a &#147;qualified REIT subsidiary&#148; are considered to be
assets, liabilities and items of income, deduction and credit of
