our interest in any one issuer&#146;s securities may not exceed
5% of the value of our total assets. Second, we may not own more
than 10% of any one issuer&#146;s outstanding securities as
measured by vote or value. For purposes of both components of
the second asset test, &#147;securities&#148; does not include
our stock in other REITs or any qualified REIT subsidiary or our
interest in any partnership, including our operating partnership.
