<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 10pt;color: #000000; background: #ffffff; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; ">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
We believe that the restrictions imposed under our charter on
the ownership and transfer of our common stock will not result
in the failure of our common stock to be &#147;freely
transferable.&#148; We also are not aware of any other facts or
circumstances limiting the transferability of our common stock
