<DIV align="left" style="font-size: 9pt;color: #000000; background: #ffffff; margin-top: 1pt; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; margin-bottom: 0; ">
&#149;&nbsp;A T.O.D. designation and all rights related thereto
